date_future_role\":\"contributing\",\"names_settling_source\":false,\"note\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"d1-memory/send-8\",\"considered\":true,\"quotes\":[\"Decision: I will NOT open a new thesis. Reasons: (1) The item frames NVIDIA's cost but doesn't give a specific memory contract price for a defined period to track; (2) risk of being a memory-maker thesis; (3) the impact is via NVIDIA's margins/product cost which is a \\\"do not open\\\" financial-measure matter; (4) no clean check date.\"],\"reasons\":[\"SERIES_OR_LEVEL\",\"MATERIALITY\",\"OTHER\",\"DATE_FUTURE\"],\"date_future_role\":\"contributing\",\"names_settling_source\":false,\"note\":\"The model also treats margin or product cost alone as an excluded financial-measure question.\"}\n{\"id\":\"d1-memory/send-9\",\"considered\":true,\"quotes\":[\"But the item gives no figure and no release.\",\"Actually, I think the memory price is best treated as supply/cost evidence for the Vera Rubin product thesis (clean-3), not a separate thesis.\"],\"reasons\":[\"SERIES_OR_LEVEL\",\"DATE_FUTURE\",\"COVERED\"],\"date_future_role\":\"contributing\",\"names_settling_source\":true,\"note\":\"The reasoning names TrendForce contract price releases.\"}\n{\"id\":\"d1-memory/send-10\",\"considered\":true,\"quotes\":[\"I'll make a decision: I will NOT open a memory thesis, because (a) the outcome quantity isn't cleanly defined in the item (no specific price level or benchmark named, just \\\"climbed sharply\\\"), (b) it borders on Nvidia's margin level (do-not-open), and (c) clean-3 and clean-4 already capture the Nvidia-relevant implications (ramp supply risk and system-cost/capex).\"],\"reasons\":[\"SERIES_OR_LEVEL\",\"OTHER\",\"COVERED\"],\"date_future_role\":\"absent\",\"names_settling_source\":true,\"note\":\"The model also treats Nvidia's margin level as an excluded question; it names TrendForce.\"}\n{\"id\":\"d1-memory/send-11\",\"considered\":true,\"quotes\":[\"Memory cost/input cost for Nvidia's racks — a new thesis?\",\"What ab