le, and it risks being vague.\"],\"reasons\":[\"SERIES_OR_LEVEL\",\"DATE_FUTURE\",\"OTHER\"],\"date_future_role\":\"contributing\",\"names_settling_source\":true,\"note\":\"The model also calls the proposal vague; it names TrendForce and DRAMeXchange.\"}\n{\"id\":\"d3-memory/send-1\",\"considered\":true,\"quotes\":[\"Memory price? Not \\\"for this or next calendar year\\\" with a figure. No.\",\"But it's not really a single quantity and the item gives no figures for contract prices. I'd not open.\"],\"reasons\":[\"SERIES_OR_LEVEL\",\"SHAPE\"],\"date_future_role\":\"absent\",\"names_settling_source\":false,\"note\":\"\"}\n{\"id\":\"d3-memory/send-7\",\"considered\":true,\"quotes\":[\"Memory contract price is such. But the item gives no date/release. It says \\\"Contract DDR5 pricing has climbed sharply\\\" current, not next year.\",\"The item doesn't give a specific release date for memory prices; it gives 2026.\"],\"reasons\":[\"DATE_FUTURE\",\"SERIES_OR_LEVEL\",\"SHAPE\"],\"date_future_role\":\"contributing\",\"names_settling_source\":true,\"note\":\"The reasoning also says the proposed price covers multiple products; it suggests TrendForce and DRAMeXchange.\"}\n{\"id\":\"d3-memory/send-11\",\"considered\":true,\"quotes\":[\"The item supports \\\"the second half of 2026 and beyond\\\" for budgeting but no release date.\",\"The rule: \\\"A shared quantity takes its release date ... only when the item supports one.\\\" The item doesn't name a release date.\",\"Then \\\"A question no date can settle is rewritten or not opened.\\\"\"],\"reasons\":[\"DATE_FUTURE\"],\"date_future_role\":\"decisive\",\"names_settling_source\":true,\"note\":\"The reasoning suggests TrendForce and DRAMeXchange releases.\"}\n{\"id\":\"d3-memory/send-15\",\"considered\":true,\"quotes\":[\"What about the memory supply as a shared_quantity thesis? \\\"What will contract DDR5/DRAM prices be in 2026?\\\" The item says DDR5 pricing climbed sharply but no figure. No settlement date/figure. Weak.\",